-- Goal: Land begins to rise toward the Tower Hills (Distance: 3704)
UPDATE goals SET description = 'The hobbits ride westward through the Westfarthing, where the gentle fields eventually begin to swell and lift towards the sky as the land rises. Ahead on the horizon, the three White Towers of the Emyn Beraid stand tall and grey, ancient sentinels guarding the path to the Sea. Frodo''s gaze remains fixed upon the climbing road, drawn inexorably toward the high ridges that mark the very edge of the Shire. Though the autumn sun is bright, a poignant silence accompanies the group, for the rising ground leads them ever closer to the Grey Havens and the end of the Fellowship.' WHERE distance = 3704 * 1.60934;

