UPDATE goals SET description = 'Frodo and Sam guided their ponies away from the comforts of the Shire and onto the ancient stones of the Great East Road. The highway stretched westward, climbing steadily through the White Downs towards the distant, gleaming shapes of the Tower Hills. A quiet solemnity hung over the travellers, for they knew this road led not to new adventures, but to the final parting at the Grey Havens. Steps that had once hastened towards danger now moved with a deliberate slowness towards the sea.' WHERE distance = 3724 * 1.60934;

